摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"基于 MinerU 的 DeepSeek Harness 多模态文档解析插件：PDF/Word/PPT/Excel/HTML/图片 → 结构化 Markdown（免 Token 的 Agent 轻量解析 / 精准解析双 API 模式）","id":"gh:1335606489","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-mineru","slug":"Lee-Hilex/dsh-mineru","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-ai","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh","dsh-agent-teams","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","mineru"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"基于 MinerU 的 DeepSeek Harness 多模态文档解析插件：PDF/Word/PPT/Excel/HTML/图片 → 结构化 Markdown（免 Token 的 Agent 轻量解"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"eek Harness 多模态文档解析插件：PDF/Word/PPT/Excel/HTML/图片 → 结构化 Markdown（免 Token 的 Agent 轻量解析 / 精准解析双 API 模式）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-mineru"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Repository: <https://github.com/Lee-Hilex/dsh-mineru> · npm: `dsh-mineru` · Changelog"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**dsh-mineru** is a **MinerU-powered multimodal document parsing plugin** for DeepSeek Harness (dsh)"},{"id":"p5s2","text":": turn PDF, Word, PPT, Excel, HTML, and images into **structured Markdown**. Configure a MinerU toke"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"n to use the 🎯 Precision API, or leave it blank and use the ⚡ Agent API (tokenless, IP rate-limited)"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" to use the 🎯 Precision API, or leave it blank and use the ⚡ Agent API (tokenless, IP rate-limited)."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Data leaves this machine**: every parse uploads your file to MinerU's remote service — there "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"is **no fully offline mode**. Do not use it for confidential / case material that must stay on-premi"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ses. See Security model."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Overview · Quick start · Two API modes · Tools · Results & artifacts · Configuration · Usage tips "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"· Web UI · Rate limits & reliability · Error code reference · Security model · FAQ · Development & p"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ublishing · Contributing · License"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Overview"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### What is this?"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"dsh-mineru plugs MinerU (OpenDataLab's high-precision document parsing engine) into the DeepSeek Har"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ness agent ecosystem, letting **text-only models \"read\" documents**: the model receives structured M"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"arkdown (tables, formulas, and images preserved) instead of binary files it cannot open."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Typical use cases:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- Read papers / contracts / reports: parse a PDF, then ask the agent to summarize or extract data;\n-"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" Batch-processing documents: parse dozens of files in one call, each producing Markdown;\n- OCR for i"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"mages / screenshots: scanned pages and web screenshots become searchable text;\n- Formulas & tables: "},{"id":"p13s4","text":"math formulas in papers and Excel tables survive with full structure."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Supported file formats"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Format | Precision API (token required) | Agent API (tokenless) |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| PDF | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Word (`.doc` / `.docx`) | ✅ | ✅ (`.docx` only) |\n| PPT (`.ppt` / `.pptx`) | ✅ | ✅ "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"(`.pptx` only) |\n| Excel (`.xls` / `.xlsx`) | ✅ | ✅ (`.xlsx` only) |\n| HTML (`.html` / `.htm`) | ✅ ("},{"id":"p16s3","text":"forces MinerU-HTML model) | ❌ |\n| Images (`.png` `.jpg` `.jpeg` `.jp2` `.webp` `.gif` `.bmp`) | ✅ | "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ces MinerU-HTML model) | ❌ |\n| Images (`.png` `.jpg` `.jpeg` `.jp2` `.webp` `.gif` `.bmp`) | ✅ | ✅ |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> Note: the Agent API does not support `.doc` / `.ppt` / `.xls` (legacy Office formats) or HTML — us"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"e the Precision API (token required) for those."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Highlights"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 compatibility** — tested with the real Loader, settings service and tool runtime;"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" the `0.1.5-rc.x` peer range and legacy settings path are retained;\n- **Dual API modes, auto-selecte"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"d** — chooses Precision or Agent parsing based on whether a token is configured; can be overridden p"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"er call;\n- **Progressive tool exposure** — only the tiny `mineru_activate` bootstrap is visible unti"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"l the agent activates the full toolset, saving context;\n- **Drag-and-drop uploads** — drop a file in"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"to the chat; its path lands in the composer draft so text-only models can process documents;\n- **Aut"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"o-chunked batch parsing** — submit hundreds of files/URLs at once; batching respects official limits"},{"id":"p19s8","text":" automatically;\n- **Rate-limit aware** — built-in token buckets, daily caps, 429 backoff, and action"},{"id":"p19s9","text":"able messages for every error code;\n- **Artifact-backed results** — parsed output lands in the works"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"pace as files with signed preview links in the Web UI."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Step 1: Install"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"> **Note**: Requires DeepSeek Harness `0.2.0-rc.1` or newer on the `0.2.0` line, or a compatible `0."},{"id":"p22s2","text":"1.5-rc.x` installation, with the `dsh` CLI available. On the `0.2.0` line, use plugin `0.1.15` or la"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ter: `0.1.14` covers only `0.2.0-rc.2+`, `0.1.13` only the older host range. If npm still serves `0."},{"id":"p22s4","text":"1.13`, install a source-built tarball below."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**From npm (recommended)**"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**Build from source** (development / preview latest changes)"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Run `npm pack` again and re-install after changing the source. Local installs must use the tarball ("},{"id":"p27s2","text":"`pnpm link:` installs resolve `@deepseek-ai` peers outside the profile)."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For the desktop profile, use `dsh plugin --profile desktop add ./dsh-mineru-0.1.14.tgz`. Compatible "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"package metadata passes the runtime gate without an `allow-version` exemption. `npm run test:compat`"},{"id":"p28s3","text":" runs only the real-runtime compatibility checks; MinerU responses are simulated, so the tests uploa"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"d no documents and consume no API quota."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Step 2: Verify the install"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Expected output (a `# ==` comment line plus your plugin row):"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Then restart a running Web profile (`dsh web`) and open **Settings → Plugins → MinerU 解析**."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### Step 3: Configure (optional)"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"**No token needed to get started** — the plugin automatically falls back to the tokenless Agent API."},{"id":"p35s2","text":" Add a token to unlock the full feature set (Precision API, batch parsing, HTML, more formats):"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- **Web UI**: Settings → Plugins → **MinerU 解析** → paste the token into the write-only field (blank "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"keeps the existing value);\n- **Headless / CLI**: put `MINERU_API_TOKEN: <token>` in `$DSH_HOME/.cred"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"entials.yaml`, or export the `MINERU_API_TOKEN` environment variable."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The token is resolved once per operation — **rotations take effect on the very next call without a r"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"estart**. Get a token by registering at <https://mineru.net> (API management page)."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### Step 4: Use it"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"**Web UI** (drag-and-drop friendly):"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"1. **Drag** a PDF/Word/image into the chat — the file is saved to the session workspace and its path"},{"id":"p40s2","text":" is filled into the composer draft (never auto-sent);\n2. Add your request, e.g. \"Parse this PDF to M"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"arkdown and summarize the key points\";\n3. Send. The agent activates the toolset and calls `mineru_pa"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"rse`; results come back as files you can preview."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"**URL parsing**: just tell the agent \"parse this document: https://example.com/paper.pdf\"."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Security model"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

